    "names": "Eleven of the sixteen sets are literally named 'App Name' in Figma, and every card's Title text says 'App icon'. The `identified` field is a visual reading of the 256px render, not data from the file. It has to be confirmed before import, because a wrong reading silently attaches the wrong drawing.",
